{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人楊偲泳昨日（6號）33歲生日，她在社交網分享同大班朋友慶祝，及收到很多禮物，她說：「他們送了我最喜歡的東西：鬱金香、TIRAMISU、還有滿滿的愛。</p><p>」並留言：「萬分感謝！</p><p>」不少圈中藝人包括佘詩曼、謝安琪、王丹妮、羅孝勇、朱栢康和劉沛蘅齊</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.658640+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:01:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"7d5f92a69660f78a3ac77c27af57fa7010dc4501fec07a7258d20f1b95236ea2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}